<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0655_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? I can’t hear you. The\nconnection trash.\rCall back from somewhere else!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nAnything new goin’ on with you?\fI’m the same as usual. I already knew.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s stronger Block Bosses\nthan me, you know. That’s no good!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I think I got some free time on\nSundays around noon.\rCould you call me back then?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah, wonderful!\nI got some free time right now.\rYou wanna scrap again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I knew it. That’s just like you.\rSo, I’ll see you at\nthe Saffron Dojo then!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\nYou got the right to say no.\fI shouldn’t have got my hopes up.\fBut I’m still a lil disappointed...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You deadass got free time to\nscrap me?\rIf you got plans with other people,\nyou should do that first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\nDon’t forget!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeah, this Sabrina.\nI knew you’d call.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, I’m pretty sure we made plans to\nmeet at the Fighting Dojo in\fSaffron City... You REALLY forgot?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme tell you a lil about a Psychic’s\ntrainin’.\rPsychic ability is the power to\ninfluence people.\rYou close your eyes and clear your\nmind of extra thoughts...then you look\fhard at your sleepin’ self.\rThat’s it.\rReal Psychics ain’t the kind who\nmove stuff with their minds.\rIt’s about controllin’ your own mind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You... You gon’ get even stronger\nthan you now, I know it...\rYou gon’ beat every Hustler you face\nand eventually reach the\fglowin’ glory...\rI just wanted to tell you that.\nTalk to you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You a great Hustler, with a good\nbalance of brains, power, and\fheart.\rBut above all, the power of your heart\nis what’s special.\rWhat you think about honestly tryin’\nto study bein’ a Psychic once?\rBet you could be a better Psychic\nthan me if you tried...</language>
	</row>
</body>
